ces, the grain of the wood furniture, faint wrinkles in the bedding — enhance the realism and atmosphere. The environment feels calm, private, mature, and lived-in."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [430, 310], "pos": [-840, -80], "id": 42, "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-node-suite-comfyui", "ver": "ea935d1044ae5a26efa54ebeb18fe9020af49a45", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [45], "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["ae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae名称"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [350, 60], "pos": [-790, 420], "id": 17, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"vae_name": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [66], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "lumina2", "cpu"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [351.96160888671875, 106], "pos": [-790, 270], "id": 18, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"